nput': [{'parameter': 'r', 'value': 'Record of type Type.A that belongs to an RRset where (size + sigSize) == 1 (e.g., a single A record, no signatures)'}], 'expected': 'removeRRsetWithoutLock(name, Type.A) is invoked; the RRset is removed from the zone', 'description': 'If the RRset would become empty after removing the record, the method should remove the entire RRset (and possibly the name) by calling removeRRsetWithoutLock.'}]}]
